agdoll\n- Anti stun\n- Clear debuffs\n\nESP\n- Player chams (custom colors)\n- Names, distance and health\n- Ability and killer type labels\n- Boxes and tracers\n- Through walls\n- Show killers, survivors or ghosts\n- Max distance\n- Off screen killer arrow\n- Killer nearby alert (adjustable distance)\n\nWORLD\n- Fullbright\n- No fog\n- Remove screen effects\n- Custom FOV\n- Show hitboxes, hurtboxes and collision boxes\n- Server position visualizer\n\nPLAYER\n- Full stats page (rank, points, boost, playtime)\n- Equip owned killers and outfits\n- Body type and charm side\n- Anti cheat flag warning\n\nSETTINGS\n- Rebindable menu key\n- Anti AFK\n- Panic key, stops everything instantly\n- Rejoin server\n- Feature keybinds (fly, noclip, ESP, aimbot)\n- Configs (auto saves)","tags":["die of death","dod"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://cdn.forgehub.store/loader\"))()","owner":{"_id":"66d507dd4aeed5239fe4c156","username":"Skuppy","verified":true,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/1378518a7cf86a82daaf0fafb7a4cac020d5e4e88556f58dc8ff466874cbfb9a.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/66d507dd4aeed5239fe4c156-1726499503741.png"},"lvl":15,"status":"offline","id":"66d507dd4aeed5239fe4c156","leaderboard":{"tag":{"kind":"hall","rank":4,"period":"all","metric":"views","value":11244916}},"topMilestone":{"key":"creator.views","tier":10000000},"profile":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/1378518a7cf86a82daaf0fafb7a4cac020d5e4e88556f58dc8ff466874cbfb9a.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/66d507dd4aeed5239fe4c156-1726499503741.png"}},"verified":true,"discord":"https://discord.gg/forgehubrbx","keyLink":"https://ads.luarmor.net/get_key?for=Key_System__LootLabs-HDPDzKHSkwSZ","views":5459,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/7ab7a52bfa5abbd37be7bcaaf84d3998fb5b5a2a923fe94c1846d4f22ad3fd76.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/s